WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.190
At a baby's baptism, the
baby does not say a word.

2
00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:07.460
Parents and godparents
make the promises instead:

3
00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:10.720
to reject sin and to profess the faith.

4
00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:15.850
Years later, that baby has grown up,
with questions and opinions of their own.

5
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:20.860
So if you were baptised as a baby, when
do you get to say yes to the faith for

6
00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:22.120
yourself?

7
00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:25.270
In this mission, you'll read
a story from the Book of Acts,

8
00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:28.330
and follow a Catholic rite step by step.

9
00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:33.230
Then you'll compare the routes into full
membership in six different traditions.

10
00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:38.270
Your mission: find out when, and how,
a Christian makes the faith their own.
